            "review_title": "Review at Garden Bay Restaurant",
            "review_text": "A S\nDoha, Qatar19 contributions\n0\nTasty, a wide selection\nAug 2019 • Family\nReally enjoyed our meal here. Visited with our 4, 9 & 10 year old and the buffet had something for everyone. I filled up on traditional Vietnamese fare (really loved delicious mooli salad), my husband favoured the Chinese takeaway favourite black pepper steak, and the children ate various pastas and sushis. \n\nWe paid in advance for the buffet which included water, but paid extra for beer which wasn't particularly expensive.\nWritten August 10, 2019",
