            "review_title": "Review at Garden Bay Restaurant",
            "review_text": "quachmydung2017\nHanoi, Vietnam59 contributions\n0\nSuch a nice restaurant\nJun 2019 • Friends\nGarden Bay Restaurant served us a buffet on the first night were were there and we were very satisfied. We had a very large variety of dishes to choose: from Vietnamese dishes to Western and Japanese dishes. The raw salmon was especially delicious. They had a big choice of dessert as well which we liked very much. \nThe breakfast was a buffet one too so it was very convenient for our group which consists of both children and old people. \nThe same were well trained, professional and helpful \nWe loved to eat there because we didn’t have to travel far for our meals\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2019",
