            "review_text": "Jayson S\nMelbourne, Australia4 contributions\n0\nTop Notch\nAug 2018 • Solo\nBased on some positive reviews on Trip Advisor l decided to eat here. Was a bit strange walking into the restaurant which appears to be able to seat approximately 200 people and it being completely empty. Seemed a shame as the buffet had all been set out nicely. I decided to order from the menu as l had looked at it prior to my arrival. Ordered a cocktail \"Long Island Iced Tea' which went down very well. Caeser Salad is a favourite of mine and l selected it with chicken. It was very nice. Maybe a little extra dressing would of made superb for me, but still very good. Main course l had spaghetti marinara. Seafood was nice and fresh and it hit the spot. Service was good l guess given l was the only one there it should of been. The chef came out also and we had a good chat. Friendly guy\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
