            "review_text": "Samuel R\nBoise, Idaho27 contributions\n0\nThis Restaurant Surprised Me\nJul 2018 • Friends\nThis restaurant surprised me, I usually dont like seafood so when the person I was eating with ordered just seafood I was a little worried but it was actually really good. My favorite thing that I had there though was a Pho Roll, the sauce they had wasnt the typical sauce either. It was a littlw bit thicker which I preferred. It was the best sauce for a roll that I have had in Vietnam yet. The icing on the cake for this restaurant was how personable the waitress was. Her personality was enjoyable and so were her conversations. Will visit again if I go back to Ha Long.\nWritten July 25, 2018",
